WEBVTT

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.810
Think about why I put you out there.

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:13.700
I wouldn't have chosen you if you could only play on the right wing.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:18.950
I'm a professional manager, and this is how you will be assessed upon.

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:24.960
If you are truly a professional, then let me see you live up to my expectations.

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:31.260
Understood? I am trying to bring out your full potential.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:34.840
Don't think that you can only play well in one aspect.

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:37.760
Yes.

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:40.720
All of their play goes through Zelberto.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.940
Murakoshi, stick close to him.

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:50.980
You're working very hard, Tatsumi.

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:55.950
How can they allow a manager to coach a team without a single foreigner?

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:00.740
I will bring them to the top.

00:01:00.740 --> 00:01:02.200
It's Pepe.

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:11.590
Good, nice clear!

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:16.430
We've been constantly under siege for this game.

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:19.640
That's fine.

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:23.770
As long as we don't concede.

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:31.770
What's truly intriguing is that Tsubaki has been playing without fear.

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:41.450
Though he's still running around like a headless chicken and couldn't catch up with Carlos,

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:45.750
he does play as if he has a purpose on the pitch.

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:49.460
No, it's not just Tsubaki...

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:55.920
The whole ETU team is giving off the exact same aura.

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:59.340
If I'm right about this,

00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:03.850
then ETU definitely has a plan.

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:09.310
ETU will start to get their game going when it reaches a certain period.

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:11.860
Ishihama, get him!

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:16.990
If we don't convert our chances...

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:18.490
Will he shoot?

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:28.710
Nice block!

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:34.250
I can't take this any longer. I'm already having goosebumps!

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:35.880
Tsubaki...

00:02:36.800 --> 00:02:39.880
That kid. He's everywhere.

00:02:43.100 --> 00:02:44.260
Huh?

00:02:51.270 --> 00:02:52.020
Huh?

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:58.990
The stadium... gives off a feeling like this?

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:02.490
Alright! Okay!

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:13.450
There's always space to play into, but we can't seem to get our attacks together.

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:17.080
Why?

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:19.630
Is it because we didn't keep our momentum?

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:22.250
Hey, Zelberto!

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:26.760
What's the matter, Carlos?

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:31.010
Hey, I say, Zelberto,

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:36.190
I have this assumption.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:39.360
Which is?

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:44.320
Can I just say it out?

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:46.400
Just spill it, Carlos!

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.990
This is not the time to be standing here chatting!

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:52.490
I have to say, I...

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:53.540
Yeah?

00:05:54.950 --> 00:05:56.870
This match...

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:01.040
I'm not really enjoying it.

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:07.220
What's the matter? You have a stomach upset?

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:11.050
No, no. I don't mean that.

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:16.270
Whenever I try to pass the ball to you,

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:18.810
there's always someone there ready to intercept it.

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.110
So they've noticed.

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:29.820
As soon as I got the ball,

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:35.580
No.10 and No.7 will always appear between the both of us.

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:43.880
To tell you the truth,

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:50.800
I haven't provided you with a successful pass all day.

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.140
Zelberto! Carlos!

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:58.600
What the hell are you two doing?!

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:03.900
I feel that our team is only able to get our game going...

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:09.610
when I am able to successfully pass the ball to you, Zelberto.

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:13.570
That's the only way that caters to our playing style.

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:20.620
You might not have noticed since you are always up front passing the ball.

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:27.460
But from the back, you could see that we haven't got our momentum going at all.

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:29.840
S-So that's it...

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:32.640
That's why, I...

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:39.520
will try my best to position myself closer to you!

00:07:41.600 --> 00:07:44.730
Oh, alright.

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:57.950
Nagoya's trio of Brazilians... With their different abilities, they're so impressive that it's scary.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:03.040
Pepe possesses great pace and shooting techniques.

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:07.420
Zelberto is gifted with great vision and pin-point passing.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:14.260
But still, the most threatening one of the three...

00:08:16.350 --> 00:08:18.970
has got to be the nucleus of the team's defense and attack.

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:23.390
That's Carlos.

00:08:29.230 --> 00:08:31.610
25 minutes remaining for the second half...

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:35.280
Just like the previous half, ETU are still the inferior team.

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:42.750
It's exactly like what's been said in the half-time comments but...

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:46.580
Still, it's a terrible piece of report.

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:50.750
The least they could do is add some fancy adjectives into it.

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:57.970
Anyway, if it's going to continue like this, they're not gonna win.

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:04.390
Or on the contrary... now that we've entered this period of time, why not just hold on for a draw?

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:11.110
For a small and weak club such as ETU, we will be playing at a much higher standard.

00:09:11.110 --> 00:09:15.990
We will then beat these so-called 'big teams' to a pulp. Wouldn't that feel good?

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:18.660
Just wait and see.

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:22.750
I will transform the league of this nation into a very exciting one.

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:25.910
That's all.

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:28.920
What's with this guy?

00:09:28.920 --> 00:09:30.290
I've had it!

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:35.220
I'm not betting my whole year on him! There's still time. I have to request for a change of clubs!

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:36.930
You can.

00:09:40.260 --> 00:09:43.060
You guys can continue to believe in me.

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:50.360
Hurry up then.

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:54.360
Don't you dare tell me it's just empty words.

00:09:59.490 --> 00:10:01.490
What is it, Gotou?

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:06.120
Carlos, the full-back, has positioned himself further up the pitch.

00:10:06.120 --> 00:10:06.830
Huh?

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:12.380
This is bad.

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:15.920
The defense is barely holding up before this.

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:18.590
If Carlos is to push further forward, we're done for.

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:24.260
Zelberto and Carlos... They now have two points to initiate their attacks from.

00:10:35.980 --> 00:10:40.990
Looking at you guys play with such enthusiasm,

00:10:41.530 --> 00:10:45.370
I don't know why, but it kinda loosen me up for a bit.

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:52.290
They're starting to get serious.

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:00.470
Has it begun?

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:07.020
20 minutes left.

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:13.360
This is the point that separates the contenders from the pretenders.

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.030
It's coming!

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:26.290
They've started!

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:28.160
Carlos is overlapping!

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.160
Don't panic!

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.300
He let it through?

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:42.050
Stop him, Murakoshi!

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:48.310
Carlos again?

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:49.810
He's gonna shoot!

00:12:01.030 --> 00:12:02.860
It's Pepe!

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:08.580
Listen up!

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:13.790
What I'm going to say next is important, so pay attention.

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:19.880
I'm predicting that at some point during the second half, Carlos will be pushing forward.

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:25.140
Nagoya was dominating during the first half, and their passes were flowing well too.

00:12:25.510 --> 00:12:27.890
They are sure to think that they can score at any time.

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:32.850
However, if the second half were to stay as it was earlier on,

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:36.100
they will drive forward even more.

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:41.110
If that's the case, the first one who will do so... will be Carlos.

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:44.860
I-Is that ok, manager?

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:49.370
If the three Brazilians were to attack, even if it's us...

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:51.370
We'll be fine if they don't shoot.

00:12:51.870 --> 00:12:54.500
The opponent is an inexperienced team too.

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:58.380
The choices they have during this situation are also fairly limited.

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:00.050
Listen up.

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:04.220
There is only one issue here,

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:08.390
their best option...will be to pass the ball to Pepe.

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:19.020
Kiyokawa!

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:23.690
Th-They really did it!

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:25.900
Pass it forward, Kiyokawa!

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:31.080
Prince!

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:33.790
Crap!

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:36.960
A counter-attack!

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:39.330
Will this be it, ETU?

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:54.430
Sera!

00:13:54.430 --> 00:13:55.560
Akasaki!

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:57.940
If it's the two of them, they can do it!

00:13:57.940 --> 00:13:59.440
Go!!!

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:01.940
Track back, track back!

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:03.940
Go, go!

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:05.570
Go!

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:07.320
Prince!

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:08.820
Go!

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:22.960
Go, go!

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:24.590
Go!

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:26.340
Prince!

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:27.840
Go!

00:14:28.930 --> 00:14:29.970
I'm going.

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:38.850
Don't let him pass! Stop him!

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:40.730
Go, go!

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:41.480
Win this!

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:44.110
Nice pass, Prince!

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:48.070
I'm breaking through!

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:51.240
He's going for it!

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:52.740
Keeper!

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:54.120
Shoot!

00:15:00.710 --> 00:15:02.580
This can't be!

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:04.880
It's not out yet!

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:53.970
It's in!

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:56.300
YEAH!

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:57.850
Tsubaki!

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:12.740
I... really...

00:16:16.580 --> 00:16:17.990
Tsubaki!

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:19.370
You're superb!

00:16:19.370 --> 00:16:20.370
Tsubaki!

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:24.330
O-Ouch!

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:26.130
I'm dying!

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:29.670
Kuro!

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:31.130
Yeah!

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:33.010
Nice!

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:36.180
What are you guys doing?!

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:37.600
We only let in one.

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:39.010
It's our turn to score!

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:45.020
That bastard actually scored!

00:16:45.690 --> 00:16:48.860
That Tsubaki really has something in him!

00:16:48.860 --> 00:16:51.030
He's not the team's No.7 for nothing!

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:53.700
It's my turn to score next time!

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:55.570
Nope! The next one's mine!

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:56.660
We have to defend this hard-fought lead!

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:01.040
Th-That's painful.

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:05.170
Sorry.

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:09.960
M-Murakoshi.

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:23.180
That was a great shot there, Baki.

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:26.850
Though it lacked some elegance.

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:44.830
You just have to remain the way you are now.

00:17:46.370 --> 00:17:48.750
I heard you've been doing image training.

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:52.710
Ever since the beginning, you've been training alone after practice.

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:58.720
All the people that you've mesmerized have always been secretly cheering for you.

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:03.720
That is your potential, Tsubaki.

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:05.930
Just continue on like this.

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:07.730
No matter times you fail,

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:13.230
all you need is that one chance to dazzle the crowd...

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:15.740
and frighten your opponents.

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:20.950
Bring out the spirit of Giant Killing within you.

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:34.250
I succeeded!

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:39.180
I did it!

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:07.540
The scorer of the goal is No.7 of ETU, Tsubaki Daisuke!

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:11.080
I can't believe Tsubaki scored that goal.

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:17.010
The first half was a one-sided game,

00:19:17.010 --> 00:19:18.590
but Carlos pushed forward...

00:19:18.590 --> 00:19:23.390
and it was followed by a timely counter-attack...

00:19:26.510 --> 00:19:28.890
It all adds up.

00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:33.480
I wonder whether he actually planned this out,

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:36.820
But this has changed my perspective of him a lil'.

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:40.240
Tatsumi Takeshi.

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:43.950
But the battle has just started.

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:50.620
If they cannot hold back Nagoya's response, ETU has no chance of winning.

00:19:57.380 --> 00:20:00.170
They totally fell for it!

00:20:00.170 --> 00:20:02.760
It's just like what the manager said!

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:08.350
We can break their defense down with a counter once Carlos is taken out.

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:11.680
Maybe it's because Carlos is too exceptional a player,

00:20:11.680 --> 00:20:16.360
Nagoya is over-reliant on him for defense.

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:24.700
For every move that Carlos makes, the other defenders observe and move accordingly.

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:32.410
Hence, they don't have to worry since they have an overview of the situation. However...

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:41.260
when they have to deal with a counter-attack without Carlos, their system collapses.

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:46.590
All they needed was a center-back to do the organizing,

00:20:46.590 --> 00:20:49.260
but even that was Carlos' job.

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:53.690
And that is the chink in their armor.

00:20:54.390 --> 00:20:57.190
If there is a weakness, we simply have to exploit it.

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:04.820
He was able to analyze the opponents thoroughly with just videos of them...

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:10.660
During his playing days, he purely played based on his intuition.

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:17.170
But now, he has really become a true manager.

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:22.800
What?

00:21:23.210 --> 00:21:25.470
What's with you, Macchan?

00:21:25.470 --> 00:21:28.010
Your expression... It's disgusting.

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:32.430
I was unmarked just now!

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:34.480
Why didn't you pass it to me?

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:37.900
Why did you pass it to Pepe who was clearly being marked?

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:40.570
Are you listening, Carlos?!

00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:41.440
Stop it.

00:21:41.770 --> 00:21:43.530
Don't dwell on that incident anymore, Itagaki.

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:45.700
Don't screw with me!

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:58.080
What did Itagaki say just now?

00:21:58.630 --> 00:22:03.590
Erm... Apparently you should have passed the ball to him?

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:08.590
I'm unmarked, yet they didn't pass it to me...

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:11.010
I'm not even considered a forward anymore.

00:22:11.010 --> 00:22:13.560
Dammit!

00:22:20.270 --> 00:22:23.860
It has nothing to do with being on the right or left side anymore!

00:22:24.480 --> 00:22:26.820
I'll just aim for the goal and shoot!

00:22:33.540 --> 00:22:35.620
That should be the way.

00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:40.080
That is how a forward should be.

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:17.760
The next goal will be crucial.

00:24:17.760 --> 00:24:20.310
I won't score if I don't shoot!

00:24:20.310 --> 00:24:21.310
Go!

00:24:21.310 --> 00:24:22.480
Tsubaki!

00:24:23.730 --> 00:24:25.770
Alright! Go, go!

00:24:25.770 --> 00:24:27.980
Let them see what you've got, Tsubaki!
